u were trying to say.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-18T15:58:22-08:00","id":1546096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1545424-w5-and-the-war-of-rage?p=1546095#post1546095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, okay, that's what you were talking about. I let <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar23_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"23\" data-vbnamecard=\"23\">Saur Ops Specialist</a> respond to this first since it's his thread... but I'm a bit confused.<br /> <br /> Your mention of &quot;I'm kind of out of the loop&quot; made it seem like you were talking about a recent change and you were just unaware of it due to a lack of attention. But this is about W5. Period. You were there for that. When it was previewed, when it got released, the reception to that release... It's still just a bit mystifying to me what you were trying to say.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, I was interpreting the mention of V5 as them doing more crossover and wondering if that's why the Garou were so nerfed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-18T16:03:47-08:00","id":1546097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1545424-w5-and-the-war-of-rage?p=1546080#post1546080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What is then, if I may ask?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the first step in making crossover play more approachable, power level or not, is to not write the characters as wanting to kill a lot of the other monsters. And, as I've noted multiple times, while the kegare-like pollution of the various Triatic members isn't a thing in W5, that's putting the cart before the horse; it's just one less Gift to activate before killing the vampires because you don't care if the vampire can hide their connection to the dark side or not, they're clearly acting in a way that's harmful to others that you value, so you just go and kill them or die trying.<br /> <br /> And the Garou in W5? Still quite intent on killing vampires. Just try and fucking stop 'em! I'd declare it for other monsters, but Exalted 3e will probably release all its books in the time it takes just to get M5 out, so, unknown on the whole, but the antagonist writeups in W5 aren't really encouraging.<br /> <br /> Basically, the story-undermining exclusions of all the mechanical advantages that Garou used to enjoy are like the five-step do or don't you're screwed tracks of Harano and Hauglosk. It's a feel bad part of a system full of feel bad parts that makes you wallow in shit, presumably just before you throw the book in the corner of the room and forget about it or sell it to HPB because what's the fucking point?<br /> <br /> And it just shot itself in the foot, because, as noted, there's no way that these Garou managed to get it together for anything, genocide or otherwise. So it tries to make you feel bad about it, but there's not much of a reason it can exist in this &quot;reimagination&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":3},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-18T16:35:44-08:00","id":1546098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1545424-w5-and-the-war-of-rage?p=1546097#post1546097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Basically, the story-undermining exclusions of all the mechanical advantages that Garou used to enjoy are like the five-step do or don't you're screwed tracks of Harano and Hauglosk. It's a feel bad part of a system full of feel bad parts that makes you wallow in shit, presumably just before you throw the book in the corner of the room and forget about it or sell it to HPB because what's the fucking point?<br /> <br /> And it just shot itself in the foot, because, as noted, there's no way that these Garou managed to get it together for anything, genocide or otherwise. So it tries to make you feel bad about it, but there's not much of a reason it can exist in this &quot;reimagination&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I wonder what would happen if a someone actually decides to run a session of W5 and right at the end reveal that everything is actually a BSD gaslighiting operation (assuming the pcs decides to go along unquestionably) with the ST whipping out a w20 book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}